  "goodToKnow": "Das Pflichtspiel is a competitive match, one that counts in a league, cup or qualification, as opposed to a Freundschaftsspiel or Testspiel (friendly). Sports reports often note that a team is unbeaten in so many Pflichtspiele. Similar: die Kür (free programme) and die Pflicht (compulsory part) in figure skating: erst die Pflicht, dann die Kür (work before pleasure). Plural: die Pflichtspiele."
